      "content": "it feels like there is no \"navigating\" through this. when the music stops and the lights go out, there's nothing left to go back to. you keep talking about support and coping, but what if there's nothing left to save? if the essence of who i am is gone, isn't there something almost cruel about being forced to keep this broken body going for no reason at all?",
